    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53150" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπη</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crib, manger</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππους</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέδησαν ἐπ᾽ ἀμβροσίῃσι κάπῃσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.434
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ἱππείῃσι κάπῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.40
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουστάθμου κάπης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ κάπης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					95
				</span></i>
			: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπηθεν</span></b>  as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
